One thing that I didn't notice being mentioned that is relevant to 1)
and 2): As soon as I find the downstair, I always go down and then
come right back up.  That loads the new level and populates it with
monsters.  This way, should I happen to level up on the current level,
when I go down the monsters that are made with the level correspond to
my weaker XP level, and only those made spontaneously will correspond
to my new level.



